As of March 27, 2026, Nvidia and Microsoft are the [1st and 4th most valuable companies in the world](https://companiesmarketcap.com/) respectively. Nvidia's stock price has seen a rise of 50.6% over the past year, while Microsoft's stock has risen by 3.8%.

A spreadsheet with previous question resolutions can be found [here](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1C_AmOdivYdNuCnEn-I_ps2TJkCAVQkyKOirvhK2jZ2I/edit?gid=0#gid=0).&#x20;

