numeric.fine_print:
Ensure frequency is set to *Monthly* and units is set to *Thousands of Persons, Seasonally Adjusted*.&#x20;

In the event FRED stops timely reporting the data, Admins may name a different resolution source if they deem the methodology is substantially the same. (For example, the December 2024 result would need to be approximately 3,012 thousand or 3.012 million.) In the event it is deemed impossible to find a comparable source, this question may be **annulled**.

Please note that as of April 2025 the FRED source reports the figure in "Thousands of Persons" and this question is similarly in units of thousands of people.

multiple_choice.fine_print:
This question will resolve according to the candidate publicly announced as the nominee of the Democratic Party by the Democratic Party following the party's official presidential nominee selection process. As of April 2025, this is expected to occur at the 2028 Democratic National Convention.

In the event that the Democratic Party does not select a nominee for President of the United States before election day in 2028, this question and all sub-questions shall be annulled.&#x20;

This question will also be annulled in the event that no election for the office of President of the United States is held in 2028.

