In the event that the Republican Party does not select a nominee for President of the United States before election day in 2028, this question and all sub-questions shall be annulled.&#x20;

This question will also be annulled in the event that no election for the office of President of the United States is held in 2028.

discrete.resolution_criteria:
The question resolves to the total number of declared National Emergencies under the National Emergencies Act from April 15, 2026 until December 31, 2026, inclusive.&#x20;

Each new emergency will only be counted once. Only new emergencies will count, the continuation of an existing emergency will not be counted. Where a declaration of an emergency includes details of multiple issues - for example, of flooding and outbreak of disease, etc - this will only be counted as one declaration.

The [US Federal Register](https://www.federalregister.gov/) will be the primary source for resolution.
